  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0 adds a jsonParsed read path - GetParsedTransactionAsync / GetParsedBlockAsync / SubscribeParsedBlocksAsync - returning node-decoded instructions, token balances and logs, with each instruction keeping both its parsed and raw form. Follows semantic versioning; while on 0.x, minor releases may carry breaking changes. Changelog: https://github.com/jecacs/SolSharp/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
